 ## Background
-StyleNeRF was proposed in January 2022 by Gu et al. [S2, unofficial]. It builds on the StyleGAN framework [S1] and NeRF [S1]. It is a highly influential work that focuses on 2D image synthesis by using NeRF to bring 3D awareness to the StyleGAN image synthesis framework [S1]. It addresses the challenges of existing approaches that either cannot synthesize high-resolution images with fine details or yield noticeable 3D-inconsistent artifacts [S2, unofficial].
+StyleNeRF was proposed in October 2021 by Gu et al. [S2, unofficial]. It builds on the StyleGAN framework [S1] and NeRF [S1]. It is a highly influential work that focuses on 2D image synthesis by using NeRF to bring 3D awareness to the StyleGAN image synthesis framework [S1]. It addresses the challenges of existing approaches that either cannot synthesize high-resolution images with fine details or yield noticeable 3D-inconsistent artifacts [S2, unofficial].
 
